  "description": "People who lived for a short time and tried to leave, but ended up sitting in temporary shelters called ‘gosiwons’. 'Seongho' is a job seeker who lives in the same situation as the goshiwon residents, but still thinks he is different from them. If you put your mind to it, you can escape this place like Tails in no time! No, wouldn't it be better if the world were destroyed? A zombie appears in the next room, and screams of biting and biting can be heard from outside. I, no, we have to survive.\n**(Namu, translated)**",
